    },
    {
      "muscleGroup": "biceps",
      "severity": "mild",
      "observation": "Biceps make up only 4.8% of total volume with 2 sets, the lowest share of any group. For a muscle-building goal, this is below the recommended minimum effective volume, and the flat strength index at 101 confirms no meaningful stimulus was applied."
    }
  ],
  "deloadRecommended": false,
  "deloadReason": null,
  "actionItems": [
    "Prioritize full routine attendance next week — completing all four sessions (Upper A, Lower A, Upper B, Lower B) is the single most impactful thing you can do to get muscle growth back on track.",
