    "Add at least one additional set each for biceps and shoulders to bring their weekly volume up to a more effective range for hypertrophy — even a single extra working set per session makes a difference at this volume.",
    "In the days before your next training block, review what caused the two missed sessions this week and address that barrier directly, whether it's scheduling, fatigue, or motivation, so you can protect your consistency going forward."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "User completed only 2 of 4 planned sessions (Upper A and Lower A), resulting in 16 total sets, flat strength indexes across all muscle groups, and no progressive overload; full attendance and small load increases are the top priorities next period."
}
